8:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","$L4",null,{"label":"Ownership","title":"Designed, implemented,","accent":"integrated","sub":"What I did on each side of the project — kept separate, because they are different kinds of work. AI tools accelerated implementation; understanding the code, reviewing the output, integrating it and validating it stayed with me."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4","children":[["$","$L5","designed",{"className":"p-5 md:p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink","children":"What I designed"}],["$","$L10",null,{"items":["Product discovery: catalogue browse, filter, search and sort, each with empty, loading and error states.","The custom-print workflow: upload, analyse, configure, quote.","A capability model customers can read — available, coming soon, unavailable — so nothing unapprovable can be quoted or ordered.","An operations console for orders, customers, designs, production and issues."]}]]}],["$","$L5","implemented",{"className":"p-5 md:p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink","children":"What I implemented"}],["$","$L10",null,{"items":["One WebGL viewer behind an imperative engine class: React owns mounting, teardown and controls; the engine owns everything on the GPU.","Format loaders for STL, OBJ and glTF/GLB, each imported on demand.","A deterministic exploded view — pure maths, no randomness — so a model separates identically on every load.","A quote engine with request validation and pricing rules, plus cart, checkout, guest order tracking and the account area."]}]]}],["$","$L5","integrated",{"className":"p-5 md:p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink","children":"What I integrated"}],["$","$L10",null,{"items":["Payload CMS as the catalogue and admin back end, on PostgreSQL with Drizzle migrations.","Supabase authentication for customer accounts.","S3-compatible object storage with presigned URLs for uploaded model files.","Route handlers for quotes, models, designs, orders, checkout and health checks."]}]]}],["$","$L5","aiAssisted",{"className":"p-5 md:p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink","children":"Where AI assisted"}],["$","$L10",null,{"items":["Built in documented phases with AI coding assistance (Claude); each phase was reviewed, tested and committed separately.","A self-run production audit and screen-and-state inventory record what is verified and what is not, rather than assuming generated code works."]}]]}]]}]]}]
