,["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-ink/75","children":"Explosion directions are pure and deterministic — radial from the assembly centre, with fixed fallback axes by scene order for centred parts."}]]}]]}]}],["$","li","The storefront must never sell a material or process the business has not approved.",{"children":["$","$L5",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-[48px_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-8","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[12px] text-ink/45","children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/55","children":"Challenge"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-ink","children":"The storefront must never sell a material or process the business has not approved."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[color:var(--accent)]","children":"Approach"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-ink/75","children":"Capability status comes from a business decision ledger; the quote engine, cart, checkout and order creation all refuse anything not approved."}]]}]]}]}]]}]]}]
